description	"Jedi Mystic

Light side masters who forego the use of a Lightsaber in favor of martial arts and Force proficiency.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Mind Trick (2)
- Repulse ^3[CS1 Melee]
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (2) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block/Focus (3)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]"